  "ruleText": "He-P 813.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish the minimum standards and procedures for the certification of an adult family care residence.\n\nSource. #8595, eff 4-1-06; ss by #9899-A, eff 3-29-11; ss by #12740, INTERIM, eff 3-20-19, EXPIRED: 9-16-19\n\nNew. #12934, eff 12-6-19",
